# L3: three overlapping point lights over a flat floor at midnight, fog off.
# Red, green and blue with ranges 6, 9 and 12: each pool ends smoothly at its
# range, the colours add where they overlap, and the pillars and spheres are
# lit only on the sides facing each light.
size 640 360
camera 0 18 20  0 0 0  55 0.3 200
lighting sun 0.0 35  4 2048 150 0.6 0
clear 0.02 0.02 0.04 1
item cube 0 -0.5 0  40 1 40  0.8 0.8 0.8
light point -5 1 -2  6  1.0 0.15 0.1  4
light point 4 1 -3  9  0.15 1.0 0.2  4
light point 0 1 4  12  0.2 0.35 1.0  4
item cylinder 0 1 -2  1 1 1  0.9 0.9 0.9
item sphere -2 0.75 2  1.5 1.5 1.5  0.9 0.9 0.9
item sphere 3.5 0.75 1.5  1.5 1.5 1.5  0.9 0.9 0.9
item cube -9 1 6  2 2 2  0.9 0.9 0.9
